#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:4
#: 242b59eedd264c1a88d69beb20e44c31
msgid "Weathervaning and Wind Hold"
msgstr "风向标效应和风保持"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:6
#: 78cbd07eb7304b35b3cc7ac9e835bbab
msgid ""
"Flying a QuadPlane in significant levels of wind can present a challenge. "
"The issue is that the large wing surface offers a lot of surface area for "
"the wind to interact with. That can lead to a reduction in attitude and "
"position control and high motor and ESC load."
msgstr ""
"在大风中飞行四旋翼飞机可能是一个挑战。问题在于大机翼面为风提供了大量的作用面积。这可能导致姿态和位置控制能力下降，以及电机和 ESC 负荷增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:12
#: ddf8581fcecd4f2298b77974a140fc70
msgid ""
"To reduce the impact of wind when flying in VTOL modes the ArduPilot "
"QuadPlane code supports two features:"
msgstr "为了减少在 VTOL 模式下飞行时风的影响，ArduPilot 四旋翼飞机代码支持两项功能："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:15
#: 5babe4ff2aa345be8c85f6e84d6b3fc2
msgid "Active yaw axis weathervaning"
msgstr "主动偏航轴风向标效应"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:16
#: f95abf55478647a7a98aa89af87212fb
msgid ""
"Position hold assistance using forward or tilt rotor motors instead of only "
"using VTOL stance tilting"
msgstr "使用前向或倾转旋翼电机辅助位置保持，而非仅使用 VTOL 姿态倾斜"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:18
#: 9261ba6923d444e2b766808efad93712
msgid ""
"Together these two features can greatly reduce the impact of wind on VTOL "
"flight by keeping the aircraft pointed into the wind and reducing the area "
"of the wing exposed to the wind."
msgstr "这两项功能结合使用，可通过保持飞行器朝向迎风方向并减少机翼暴露在风中的面积，大大减少风对 VTOL 飞行的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:23
#: c868a36fe41e49249bf0a25791cc9a17
msgid "Active Weathervaning"
msgstr "主动风向标效应"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:25
#: 6e00ff561f0d4ee8b2809212cb1514e3
msgid ""
"Active weathervaning acts to turn the aircraft into the wind when flying in "
"position-controlled VTOL modes. You can enable active weathervaning by "
"setting the :ref:`Q_WVANE_ENABLE <Q_WVANE_ENABLE>` parameter to a non-zero "
"value. The default is not to use active weathervaning."
msgstr ""
"主动风向标效应在位置控制 VTOL 模式下飞行时使飞行器转向迎风。您可以通过将 :ref:`Q_WVANE_ENABLE "
"<Q_WVANE_ENABLE>` 参数设置为非零值来启用主动风向标效应。默认不使用主动风向标效应。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-weathervaning.rst:32
#: 4fc81cf78baf45389538e8a3664d4524
msgid ":ref:`Q_WVANE_ENABLE<Q_WVANE_ENABLE>` Value"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_WVANE_ENABLE<Q_WVANE_ENABLE>` 值"

